{
  "name": "EcoHash RAG demo — Chat Model + Embeddings + BGE Reranker",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EcoHash RAG demo — Chat Model + Embeddings + BGE Reranker\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Click **Test workflow** to start.\n2. **Generate Document Set** creates five sample text documents.\n3. **Insert into Vector Store** embeds them with **Generate EcoHash Embeddings** (jina-embeddings-v3) and stores them in an in-memory vector store.\n4. **EcoHash Analysis Agent** (running on the **EcoHash Chat Model**) calls the `search_docs` tool, which retrieves candidates from the vector store and reorders them with the **EcoHash BGE Reranker**.\n5. The agent replies with only the exact sentence that mentions the capital of France.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Sign up at https://ecohash.com (free starter credit included, no payment method needed).\n- Create an API key at https://console.ecohash.com and add it in n8n as an **EcoHash API** credential.\n- Select that credential on the three EcoHash nodes: Chat Model, Embeddings, and Reranker.\n- Keep the vector store memory key identical between the insert and retrieve nodes.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 608
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -384,
        240
      ],
      "id": "df083069-a9e6-4e89-bf83-2387253ecae3",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger-1",
      "name": "Manual Trigger Execution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "position": [
        -800,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {},
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "code-docs",
      "name": "Generate Document Set",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -600,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "return [\n  { json: { text: 'Paris is the capital of France.' } },\n  { json: { text: 'The Eiffel Tower is a famous landmark in Paris.' } },\n  { json: { text: 'Bananas are a good source of potassium.' } },\n  { json: { text: 'Python is a popular programming language.' } },\n  { json: { text: 'The Great Wall is located in China.' } }\n];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "vs-insert",
      "name": "Insert into Vector Store",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreInMemory",
      "position": [
        -400,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "insert",
        "memoryKey": "ecohash_smoke_vs",
        "clearStore": true
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-loader",
      "name": "Load Default Data",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.documentDefaultDataLoader",
      "position": [
        -500,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "json",
        "jsonData": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "jsonMode": "expressionData",
        "textSplittingMode": "simple"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "embeddings-1",
      "name": "Generate EcoHash Embeddings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ecohash.embeddingsEcoHash",
      "position": [
        -500,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "jina-embeddings-v3"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "ecoHashApi": {
          "name": "EcoHash API"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "code-reduce",
      "name": "Consolidate Items to Single",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        -200,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { ready: true } }];"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "agent-1",
      "name": "EcoHash Analysis Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "Use the search_docs tool to find which stored document mentions the capital of France. Reply with ONLY the exact matching document sentence, nothing else.",
        "options": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "chatmodel-1",
      "name": "Run EcoHash Chat Model",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ecohash.lmChatEcoHash",
      "position": [
        -100,
        250
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "GLM-5.2",
        "temperature": 0.1
      },
      "credentials": {
        "ecoHashApi": {
          "name": "EcoHash API"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "vs-retrieve-tool",
      "name": "Retrieve from Vector Store",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.vectorStoreInMemory",
      "position": [
        100,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "topK": 2,
        "toolName": "search_docs",
        "memoryKey": "ecohash_smoke_vs",
        "useReranker": true,
        "toolDescription": "Search the stored documents for relevant sentences. Input should be a search query."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "reranker-1",
      "name": "Reorder with EcoHash Reranker",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ecohash.ecoHashReranker",
      "position": [
        150,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "topK": 2,
        "model": "bge-reranker-v2-m3"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "ecoHashApi": {
          "name": "EcoHash API"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
